# shadcn/ui

- Search the registry before writing a primitive. Hand-author only when nothing there fits, and say why in the spec.
- After add, move the files to `shared/ui/<name>/` and export a named symbol. No default export.
- The slice `index.ts` is the public surface. Callers do not deep-import the generated file.
- Swap hardcoded colors for semantic tokens. Variants use `cva` and `cn()`.
- Do not remove Radix ARIA or keyboard behavior while adapting the markup.

Recipes: `skills/create-shared-ui/references/registry.md`.
